Ok actually this is still written by a human.

[list]
[*]Install it like any other OpenMW mod and dont forget to enable the .omwscript file in OpenMW laucnher.
[/list]

If thats literally the first OpenMW mod you are installing ever (crazy! welcome!) - [url=https://modding-openmw.com/tips/installing-mods/]read this tutorial[/url].

Now I give the stage to AI for sure.

[size=5][b]For Developers[/b][/size]

MSS can be used by any OpenMW Lua mod: cached, shared reads of equipment, active effects, the interaction ray, combat targets, health decreases and more, with a cache lifetime you choose per request. All of it is documented in the [url=https://github.com/MaxYari/MaxYarisScriptServicesOpenMW#for-developers]git repository[/url]. If you are already reading this on git - just read below.
